; Loopback-only egress for the OpenCode V2 native qualification process tree (macOS seatbelt).
; Applied with `sandbox-exec -f` around each scope run, so the hosted runner's own control channel
; keeps working while every test, bigbud and retail OpenCode child can reach only localhost/UNIX
; sockets. Verified locally: in-sandbox loopback HTTP 200, external HTTPS EPERM.
; Its SHA-256 is part of the environment evidence; any edit requires a new approval record.
(version 1)
(allow default)
(deny network-outbound)
(allow network-outbound (remote ip "localhost:*"))
(allow network-outbound (remote unix-socket))
